  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "wiki-fixed",
  "description": "This repository contains the Wiki-Fixed corpus, presented in the paper Retrieval, Reward, and Training Protocols: What Matters in Training Search Agents?.\nCode: https://github.com/YiboZhao624/SearchAgentReview\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDescription\n\t\n\nThe Wiki-Fixed corpus is based on the Wikipedia 2018 (Wiki-18) corpus and supplemented by the HotpotQA, 2WikiMultiHopQA, and Musique datasets. Compared to the original Wiki-18 corpus, this version contains 295,311 new documents which are critical for answering\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/ybyby624/wiki-fixed.",
